('mutex Pitfall', 'Which mistake is most closely related to mutex?', 'MCQ', 'EASY', 'OPERATING_SYSTEM', 'Thread', '["Forgetting to release the lock on every path","Assuming it always has zero cost and no side effects","Using it without checking whether the input data matches the assumption","Treating all implementations as identical in every database or operating system"]', 'Forgetting to release the lock on every path'),
