('Clock algorithm Example', 'Which example correctly demonstrates Clock algorithm?', 'MCQ', 'MEDIUM', 'OPERATING_SYSTEM', 'Memory Management', '["A referenced page gets its bit cleared and is skipped once","A comment that says the code is correct","A variable name chosen because it looks readable","A command or query that does not reference the concept"]', 'A referenced page gets its bit cleared and is skipped once'),
