('twophase commit Pitfall', 'Which mistake is most closely related to two-phase commit?', 'MCQ', 'HARD', 'DBMS', 'Transactions', '["Ignoring that 2PC can block participants if the coordinator fails","Assuming it always has zero cost and no side effects","Using it without checking whether the input data matches the assumption","Treating all implementations as identical in every database or operating system"]', 'Ignoring that 2PC can block participants if the coordinator fails'),
('twophase commit Example', 'Which example correctly demonstrates two-phase commit?', 'MCQ', 'HARD', 'DBMS', 'Transactions', '["Participants vote yes during prepare, then coordinator sends commit","A comment that says the code is correct","A variable name chosen because it looks readable","A command or query that does not reference the concept"]', 'Participants vote yes during prepare, then coordinator sends commit'),
